        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Slanted-roof construction, integrated, on roof, p</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Slanted-roof construction, integrated, on roof, p
Production of different additional components necessary for the montage of a 3kWp photovoltaic plant. ;
UUID: 390a147c-8278-3d5a-9cfc-41c9eab10414
Materials and packaging for the production and estimation for metal processing. Disposal of the product after use.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Construction parts for a photovoltaic system with 36 cell modules and a capacity of 3kWp
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Detailed analysis of materials for one product in a diploma thesis. 
Extrapolations: From one product to the whole market.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_390a147c-8278-3d5a-9cfc-41c9eab10414.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
